   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Ultimately, Tecumseh’s confederacy plans failed because of",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1168776,
     "content_html": "the death of his brother, the prophet Tenskwatawa"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168775,
     "content_html": "the successful U.S. invasion of Canada"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168777,
     "content_html": "a combined loss of Native American leadership and British support"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168774,
     "content_html": "the purchase of the Louisiana Territory"
    }
